```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: chained operations maintain separate scopes")
val data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
val result = data.filter(_ > 1).map(_ * 3)
expect result == [6, 9, 12, 15]
```

